                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Got this after buying - and loving - Well Dweller. Of course, this is a much smaller game, but the developer's good touch is still there - very nice-feeling controls, a good sense of humor, and overall a very fun experience, with accessibility options for those - like me - who don't want to be overwhelmed by the challenge, so I played on Easy mode.\r\n\r\nGot 104%. I only had trouble in some segments where I had to figure out the next step in my journey. The graphics are nice but a bit samey throughout the whole game, which is OK for an inexperienced developer.\r\n\r\n7/10",
